  <!-- EN: Disable realistic pre-industrial/melee weapon maintenance -->
  <RG_Settings_RealisticPreIndustrialWeaponMaintenanceDisabled>禁用真实化的工业化时代之前的以及近战武器的维护</RG_Settings_RealisticPreIndustrialWeaponMaintenanceDisabled>
  <!-- EN: if disabled, pre-spacer melee weapons and neolithic/medieval weapons will no longer be cost-free until condition drops below 75%, becoming irreparably damaged.
  Instead, these weapons will be treated like all other repairable items, requiring materials for repair and becoming irraparably damaged at the threshold set below. -->
  <RG_Settings_RealisticPreIndustrialWeaponMaintenanceDisabled_Tooltip>如果禁用，近战武器和石器时代、中世纪的武器将不会在状态降到75%，受到无法修复的损坏之前无损维护。
  相反，这些武器将会像其他可修复物品一样，需要材料才能修复，并在下面设定的阈值之下受到无法修复的损坏。</RG_Settings_RealisticPreIndustrialWeaponMaintenanceDisabled_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Minimum repair chance to allow on bills ({0}%) -->
  <RG_Settings_MinimumChance>允许的最小修复成功几率（{0}%）</RG_Settings_MinimumChance>
  <!-- EN: Pawns won't repair an item if their success chance is below this value. 
  This will be ignored if you force a repair job via the item right click menu option. -->
  <RG_Settings_MinimumChance_Tooltip>如果成功率低于这个值，殖民者就不会去修理物品。
  如果通过右键单击强制执行维修任务，则会忽略该选项。</RG_Settings_MinimumChance_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Repair chance multiplier ({0}x) -->
  <RG_Settings_RepairChance>修复成功倍率（{0}X）</RG_Settings_RepairChance>
  <!-- EN: Item condition, tech-level, unlocked research, crafting skill level, manipulation, and sight are all taken into consideration in the default calculation of the repair success chance. 
  If you find the final repair chance too challenging use this to boost it up. You can also go lower if you're a masochist.
   -->
  <RG_Settings_RepairChance_Tooltip>在修复成功率的默认计算中，物品条件，技术水平，解锁研究，手工技能，操作能力和视觉能力都会考虑在内。
  如果你觉得最后的修复成功率挑战性太强，可以用这个来提高成功率，当然，如果你是受虐狂，也可以设的更低。</RG_Settings_RepairChance_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Gain in condition for partial success ({0}%) -->
  <RG_Settings_PartialSuccessRepairAmount>部分成功的效果（{0}%）</RG_Settings_PartialSuccessRepairAmount>
  <!-- EN: This adds an extra challenge, specially for badly damaged items. 
  Resources will be consumed, but the item will only gain this much condition. 
  Set to 100% to opt-out of this feature. 
  NOTE: even with this active, there is still a chance (albeit lower) that the pawn will fully restore an item. -->
  <RG_Settings_PartialSuccessRepairAmount_Tooltip>该选项增加了一个对于严重损坏的物品来说尤为重要的额外挑战。
  资源会被消耗，但是物品只能维修到这个程度。
  设置为100%即可退出该功能。
  注意：即便激活了该选项，殖民者仍然有几率（尽管可能性较低）完全修复物品。</RG_Settings_PartialSuccessRepairAmount_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Irreparably damaged threshold ({0}%) -->
  <RG_Settings_IrreparablyDamagedThreshold>无法修复的损坏阈值（{0}%）</RG_Settings_IrreparablyDamagedThreshold>
  <!-- EN: Once an item's condition falls below this percentage, you will not be able to repair it. -->
  <RG_Settings_IrreparablyDamagedThreshold_Tooltip>物品状况一旦低于该值，那么将无法修复。</RG_Settings_IrreparablyDamagedThreshold_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Cost Free (maintenance only) threshold ({0}%) -->
  <RG_Settings_CostFreeThreshold>免费（仅限维护）阈值（{0}%）</RG_Settings_CostFreeThreshold>
  <!-- EN: If an item's condition is equal to or greater than this percentage, the repair won't cost any materials. -->
  <RG_Settings_CostFreeThreshold_Tooltip>如果物品状况不低于该值，那么维修不会花费任何资源。</RG_Settings_CostFreeThreshold_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Quality degradation [Masterwork or better] ({0}%) -->
  <RG_Settings_QualityDegradation_Master>品质下降（杰作以上）（{0}%）</RG_Settings_QualityDegradation_Master>
  <!-- EN: Quality degradation [Excellent or worse] ({0}%) -->
  <RG_Settings_QualityDegradation>品质下降（优秀以下）（{0}%）</RG_Settings_QualityDegradation>
  <!-- EN: The lower this value, the more repairs you will be able to do on an item before it loses a level of quality. Set to 0 to disable this feature. -->
  <RG_Settings_QualityDegradation_Tooltip>该值越低，在物品品质下降之前，你可以维修的次数越多。设置为0可以禁用该功能。</RG_Settings_QualityDegradation_Tooltip>
  
